RFC 005: Character Roles, Housing & Democratic Governance
1. Executive Summary
RFC 005 defines the character lifecycle, occupation mechanics, energy/resting lodging economy, and democratic political governance in OurVillage. Characters operate within strict mechanical boundaries defined by the server while generating narrative persona through RKLLM [cite: OurVillage].
