3. Democratic Town Charter & Governance Engine
All administrative authority is granted via deterministic, server-enforced voting mechanisms defined in the Town Charter [cite: OurVillage].
3.1 Elective Offices
Town Mayor: Elected every 7 in-game days [cite: OurVillage]. Can set Market Stall tax rates (0-10%) and allocate municipal funds from the civic_treasury [cite: OurVillage].
Town Clerk: Validates housing deeds, registers shop licenses, and opens municipal election ballots [cite: OurVillage].
3.2 Ballot & Voting Intent Standard
Votes are cast via deterministic MQTT intent payloads processed directly by SQLite [cite: OurVillage]:
{
  "intent_id": "vote_102",
  "action": "CAST_VOTE",
  "payload": {
    "ballot_id": "election_mayor_cycle_04",
    "candidate_id": "agent_cleric_julian"
  }
}



